      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIVID DREAM NZ (5) had a tough draw so was far from disgraced when midfield in a Victoria Derby heat last week. This is easier and he was in fine form prior, winning four of his other five starts this time in. Proven at this circuit and distance and looks well placed. HITCH TO HIS STAR (6) has been competitive since winning at this circuit and distance last month and kept the ball rolling last time when he came from wider for fourth to a top filly at Wagga. Can make an impact again. NEATNTIDY (4) won from this barrier when resuming at Mildura then was held up when beaten 2.8m at his most recent appearance here. Player with better luck. WOTDIDUSAAAY (3) has been hard to fault of late, winning from this barrier at Echuca before delivering again last time at Cranbourne.",
